From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:01:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rune pouch (store, withdraw, empty and the pouch
 interface)

The rune pouch and divine rune pouch (and their locked variants) store runes in the
client-visible rune_pouch_type_n/rune_pouch_quantity_n varbits (compact ids from enum 55, up to
16,000 per type, 3 or 4 types), which spells already cast from and RuneLite's Rune Pouch plugin
reads. Open shows interface 190 (varp if1 = slot count): Store/Withdraw 1/5/X/All/custom
following the client's left-click quantity buttons, drag to reorder, Examine. Empty and
use-rune-on-pouch work from the inventory. Loadouts (Configure) are not done; messages for a
full pouch or a non-rune are best guesses. Integration tests.
